10 REM ****************************************************************
11 REM * TETRIS FOR ELECTRONIKA MS 0511 (UKNC), STANDARD UKNC BASIC   *
12 REM * FLICKER-FREE: THE ACTIVE PIECE IS UPDATED BY CELL DIFF ONLY. *
13 REM * NO CLS AND NO FULL REDRAW IN THE GAME LOOP.                  *
14 REM ****************************************************************
15 REM LINE MAP
16 REM  200- 399 CONFIG, DIM, TABLES
17 REM  400- 499 TITLE, RANDOM SEED, NEW GAME
18 REM  500- 699 MAIN LOOP, GAME OVER
19 REM 1000-1599 KEYBOARD, DISPATCH, PAUSE
20 REM 2000-2299 SPAWN, RANDOMIZER
21 REM 3000-3899 MOVES, GRAVITY, COLLISION, GROUNDED STATE
22 REM 4000-4299 ROTATION AND KICKS
23 REM 5000-5299 DIFFERENTIAL RENDERER
24 REM 6000-6799 LOCK, LINE CLEAR, SCORE, LEVEL
25 REM 7000-7699 HUD
26 REM 8000-8699 DRAWING PRIMITIVES
27 REM 9000-9099 DEBUG COUNTERS
28 REM 10000+    DATA TABLES
30 REM UKNC BASIC KEEPS ONLY THE FIRST TWO LETTERS OF A NAME, SO EVERY
31 REM VARIABLE BELOW IS EXACTLY TWO LETTERS. DICTIONARY:
32 REM  BW BH  BOARD SIZE IN CELLS      BD  BOARD ARRAY (0 = EMPTY)
33 REM  CS CG  CELL SIZE AND GAP, PX    BX BY  BOARD ORIGIN, PX
34 REM  SM UC  SCREEN MODE, USE COLOR   MC TC  MAX COLOR, TEXT COLOR
35 REM  AC     ALLOW ROTATION CLIMB     ML  MAX LOCK RESETS
36 REM  SL LX  START AND MAX LEVEL      GS  GLYPH PIXEL SIZE
37 REM  CT CR CX CY  CURRENT PIECE      NT  NEXT PIECE TYPE
38 REM  PT PR PX PY  PREVIOUS PIECE     SI  SHAPE INDEX = (TYPE-1)*4+ROT
39 REM  SX SY  SHAPE CELL OFFSETS       NR SP CC  ROTS, SPAWN X, COLOR
40 REM  KX KY KN  KICK OFFSETS          KA KV NK  KEY CODES AND ACTIONS
41 REM  GD LD AG  GRAVITY, LOCK, GRACE DELAYS PER LEVEL, IN TICKS
42 REM  AX AY  OLD CELL SET             NX NY  NEW CELL SET
43 REM  GX GY V   CELL TO DRAW/ERASE    PA PB PC PD  PIXEL RECTANGLE
44 REM  GA GB GI GE GZ  GLYPH DRAWING   FT LB LL LI  FONT AND LABELS
45 REM  TK GT LK GR LR UP  TICK, GRAVITY LEFT, LOCK LEFT, GROUNDED,
46 REM                     LOCK RESETS USED, UNCOMPENSATED KICK LIFT
47 REM  SC LN LV NC  SCORE, LINES, LEVEL, LINES CLEARED NOW
48 REM  LP RC  LAST PIECE AND REPEAT COUNT   FL  0 RUN, 1 OVER, 2 QUIT
49 REM  DC EC DB  DRAW COUNT, ERASE COUNT, DEBUG FLAG
50 REM  KB KC AK  KEY CHAR, KEY CODE, ACTION
51 REM  NU NW ND TX TY  NUMBER VALUE, WORK, DIGITS, TEXT POSITION
52 REM  DX DY  MOVE DELTA               QX QY  NEXT PREVIEW ORIGIN
53 REM  H HX HY  COLLISION SCRATCH      I J X Y Z W  LOOP SCRATCH
54 REM  RX RY  ROTATION SCRATCH
60 REM SUBROUTINE INPUTS ARE LISTED AT EACH ENTRY POINT. DO NOT REUSE
61 REM SCRATCH VARIABLES ACROSS A GOSUB THAT ALSO USES THEM.
99 GOTO 200
200 REM ---------------- CONFIGURATION ----------------
201 BW%=10 : BH%=20
202 CS%=12 : CG%=2 : BX%=200 : BY%=12
203 SM%=3 : UC%=1 : MC%=8 : TC%=7 : FC%=7
204 AC%=0 : ML%=12 : SL%=0 : LX%=9
205 GS%=3 : DB%=0
206 QX%=400 : QY%=28
209 REM ---------------- ARRAYS ----------------
210 DIM BD%(9,19)
211 DIM SX%(27,3),SY%(27,3),NR%(7),SP%(7),CC%(7)
212 DIM KX%(9),KY%(9)
213 DIM GD%(9),LD%(9),AG%(9)
214 DIM FT%(29,4)
215 DIM LB%(9,8),LL%(9)
216 DIM KA%(23),KV%(23)
217 DIM AX%(3),AY%(3),NX%(3),NY%(3)
219 REM ---------------- TABLES FROM DATA ----------------
220 FOR Z%=1 TO 7
221 READ NR%(Z%),SP%(Z%),CC%(Z%)
222 IF CC%(Z%)>MC% THEN CC%(Z%)=MC%
223 FOR J%=0 TO NR%(Z%)-1
224 SI%=(Z%-1)*4+J%
225 FOR I%=0 TO 3
226 READ SX%(SI%,I%),SY%(SI%,I%)
227 NEXT I%
228 NEXT J%
229 NEXT Z%
230 READ KN%
231 FOR I%=0 TO KN%-1
232 READ KX%(I%),KY%(I%)
233 NEXT I%
234 FOR I%=0 TO LX% : READ GD%(I%) : NEXT I%
235 FOR I%=0 TO LX% : READ LD%(I%) : NEXT I%
236 FOR I%=0 TO LX% : READ AG%(I%) : NEXT I%
237 FOR I%=0 TO 29
238 FOR J%=0 TO 4 : READ FT%(I%,J%) : NEXT J%
239 NEXT I%
240 FOR I%=1 TO 9
241 READ LL%(I%)
242 FOR J%=0 TO LL%(I%)-1 : READ LB%(I%,J%) : NEXT J%
243 NEXT I%
244 READ NK%
245 FOR I%=0 TO NK%-1
246 READ KA%(I%),KV%(I%)
247 NEXT I%
400 REM ---------------- TITLE AND RANDOM SEED ----------------
401 SCREEN SM%
402 COLOR TC%,0
403 CLS
404 FC%=TC%
405 TX%=284 : TY%=110 : LI%=9 : GOSUB 7600
406 TX%=272 : TY%=140 : LI%=7 : GOSUB 7600
407 TX%=272 : TY%=160 : LI%=8 : GOSUB 7600
408 REM THE SEED IS HOW LONG THE HUMAN TOOK TO PRESS A KEY
409 RC%=0
410 KB$=INKEY$
411 IF KB$<>"" THEN GOTO 415
412 RC%=RC%+1
413 IF RC%>30000 THEN RC%=0
414 GOTO 410
415 KC%=ASC(KB$)
416 IF KC%=81 THEN GOTO 650
417 IF KC%=113 THEN GOTO 650
418 Z%=RC%-INT(RC%/23)*23
419 FOR I%=0 TO Z% : W%=INT(RND*7) : NEXT I%
450 REM ---------------- NEW GAME ----------------
451 FOR Y%=0 TO BH%-1
452 FOR X%=0 TO BW%-1 : BD%(X%,Y%)=0 : NEXT X%
453 NEXT Y%
454 SC=0 : LN%=0 : LV%=SL% : FL%=0 : TK%=0 : LP%=0 : RC%=0
455 DC%=0 : EC%=0
456 GOSUB 7000
457 GOSUB 7100
458 GOSUB 7200
459 GOSUB 2200
460 GOSUB 2000
500 REM ---------------- MAIN LOOP ----------------
501 GOSUB 1000
502 IF AK%>0 THEN GOSUB 1100
503 IF FL%>0 THEN GOTO 600
504 TK%=TK%+1
505 GT%=GT%-1
506 IF GT%<=0 THEN GOSUB 3400
507 IF FL%>0 THEN GOTO 600
508 IF GR%=0 THEN GOTO 501
509 LK%=LK%-1
510 IF LK%>0 THEN GOTO 501
511 GOSUB 6000
512 GOTO 503
600 REM ---------------- GAME OVER ----------------
601 IF FL%=2 THEN GOTO 650
602 FC%=TC%
603 TX%=QX% : TY%=215 : LI%=5 : GOSUB 7600
604 TX%=400 : TY%=240 : LI%=7 : GOSUB 7600
605 TX%=490 : TY%=240 : LI%=8 : GOSUB 7600
610 KB$=INKEY$
611 IF KB$="" THEN GOTO 610
612 KC%=ASC(KB$)
613 IF KC%=80 THEN GOTO 450
614 IF KC%=112 THEN GOTO 450
615 IF KC%=81 THEN GOTO 650
616 IF KC%=113 THEN GOTO 650
617 GOTO 610
650 SCREEN 0
651 CLS
652 END
1000 REM ---- READ ONE KEY, OUT: AK% ACTION OR 0 ----
1001 AK%=0
1002 KB$=INKEY$
1003 IF KB$="" THEN RETURN
1004 KC%=ASC(KB$)
1005 FOR I%=0 TO NK%-1
1006 IF KC%=KA%(I%) THEN AK%=KV%(I%)
1007 NEXT I%
1008 RETURN
1100 REM ---- DISPATCH ACTION AK% ----
1101 IF AK%=1 THEN GOSUB 3000
1102 IF AK%=2 THEN GOSUB 3100
1103 IF AK%=3 THEN GOSUB 3200
1104 IF AK%=4 THEN GOSUB 4000
1105 IF AK%=5 THEN GOSUB 3300
1106 IF AK%=6 THEN GOSUB 1400
1107 IF AK%=7 THEN FL%=2
1108 IF DB%=1 THEN GOSUB 9010
1109 RETURN
1400 REM ---- PAUSE UNTIL THE PAUSE KEY IS PRESSED AGAIN ----
1401 FC%=TC%
1402 TX%=QX% : TY%=215 : LI%=6 : GOSUB 7600
1403 KB$=INKEY$
1404 IF KB$="" THEN GOTO 1403
1405 KC%=ASC(KB$)
1406 IF KC%=80 THEN GOTO 1409
1407 IF KC%=112 THEN GOTO 1409
1408 GOTO 1403
1409 ND%=5 : TX%=QX% : TY%=215 : GOSUB 7700
1410 RETURN
2000 REM ---- SPAWN: NEXT BECOMES CURRENT, SETS FL%=1 ON GAME OVER ----
2001 CT%=NT% : CR%=0 : CX%=SP%(CT%) : CY%=0
2002 UP%=0 : GR%=0 : LR%=0 : GT%=GD%(LV%)
2003 GOSUB 3600
2004 IF Q%=1 THEN FL%=1
2005 IF Q%=1 THEN RETURN
2006 FOR I%=0 TO 3 : AX%(I%)=-9 : AY%(I%)=-9 : NEXT I%
2007 GOSUB 5100
2008 GOSUB 2200
2009 GOSUB 7300
2010 RETURN
2200 REM ---- PICK NEXT TYPE INTO NT%, ONE REROLL AFTER 3 REPEATS ----
2201 GOSUB 2250
2202 IF Z%<>LP% THEN GOTO 2206
2203 RC%=RC%+1
2204 IF RC%<3 THEN GOTO 2207
2205 GOSUB 2250 : RC%=0 : GOTO 2207
2206 RC%=0
2207 NT%=Z% : LP%=Z%
2208 RETURN
2250 REM ---- RANDOM PIECE TYPE 1..7 INTO Z% ----
2251 Z%=INT(RND*7)+1
2252 IF Z%>7 THEN Z%=7
2253 RETURN
3000 REM ---- MOVE LEFT ----
3001 DX%=-1 : DY%=0
3002 GOSUB 3500
3003 IF Q%=0 THEN GOSUB 3800
3004 RETURN
3100 REM ---- MOVE RIGHT ----
3101 DX%=1 : DY%=0
3102 GOSUB 3500
3103 IF Q%=0 THEN GOSUB 3800
3104 RETURN
3200 REM ---- SOFT DROP ONE CELL ----
3201 DX%=0 : DY%=1
3202 GOSUB 3500
3203 IF Q%=1 THEN GOTO 3207
3204 SC=SC+(LV%+1)
3205 GT%=GD%(LV%)
3206 GOSUB 7100 : RETURN
3207 GOSUB 3700
3208 RETURN
3300 REM ---- HARD DROP, NO IMMEDIATE LOCK ----
3301 GOSUB 5000
3302 Z%=0
3303 CY%=CY%+1
3304 GOSUB 3600
3305 IF Q%=0 THEN GOTO 3312
3306 CY%=CY%-1
3307 IF Z%>0 THEN GOSUB 3320
3308 GOSUB 3700
3309 RETURN
3312 Z%=Z%+1
3313 GOTO 3303
3320 REM ---- COMMIT HARD DROP OF Z% CELLS ----
3321 SC=SC+2*Z%*(LV%+1)
3322 UP%=0
3323 GOSUB 5100
3324 GOSUB 7100
3325 RETURN
3400 REM ---- GRAVITY TICK ----
3401 DX%=0 : DY%=1
3402 GOSUB 3500
3403 IF Q%=1 THEN GOTO 3406
3404 GR%=0
3405 GT%=GD%(LV%) : RETURN
3406 GOSUB 3700
3407 GT%=GD%(LV%)
3408 RETURN
3500 REM ---- TRY MOVE BY DX%,DY%. OUT: Q% 0 MOVED, 1 BLOCKED ----
3501 GOSUB 5000
3502 CX%=CX%+DX% : CY%=CY%+DY%
3503 GOSUB 3600
3504 IF Q%=0 THEN GOTO 3507
3505 CX%=CX%-DX% : CY%=CY%-DY%
3506 RETURN
3507 IF DY%>0 THEN UP%=0
3508 GOSUB 5100
3509 RETURN
3600 REM ---- COLLISION OF CT%,CR%,CX%,CY%. OUT: Q% 1 = HIT ----
3601 SI%=(CT%-1)*4+CR%
3602 Q%=0
3603 FOR H%=0 TO 3
3604 HX%=CX%+SX%(SI%,H%) : HY%=CY%+SY%(SI%,H%)
3605 IF HX%<0 THEN Q%=1
3606 IF HX%>=BW% THEN Q%=1
3607 IF HY%>=BH% THEN Q%=1
3608 IF Q%=1 THEN GOTO 3611
3609 IF HY%<0 THEN GOTO 3611
3610 IF BD%(HX%,HY%)>0 THEN Q%=1
3611 NEXT H%
3612 RETURN
3700 REM ---- ENTER GROUNDED STATE, START LOCK DELAY ----
3701 IF GR%=1 THEN RETURN
3702 GR%=1 : LK%=LD%(LV%) : LR%=0
3703 RETURN
3800 REM ---- AFTER A SUCCESSFUL PLAYER ACTION ----
3801 IF GT%<AG%(LV%) THEN GT%=AG%(LV%)
3802 IF GR%=0 THEN RETURN
3803 CY%=CY%+1
3804 GOSUB 3600
3805 CY%=CY%-1
3806 IF Q%=1 THEN GOTO 3809
3807 GR%=0
3808 RETURN
3809 IF LR%>=ML% THEN GOTO 3812
3810 LR%=LR%+1 : LK%=LD%(LV%)
3811 RETURN
3812 IF LK%<AG%(LV%) THEN LK%=AG%(LV%)
3813 RETURN
4000 REM ---- TRY ROTATE CLOCKWISE, WITH KICKS ----
4001 IF NR%(CT%)=1 THEN RETURN
4002 GOSUB 5000
4003 W%=CR%+1
4004 IF W%>=NR%(CT%) THEN W%=0
4005 RX%=CX% : RY%=CY%
4006 I%=0
4007 CR%=W% : CX%=RX%+KX%(I%) : CY%=RY%+KY%(I%)
4008 GOSUB 3600
4009 IF Q%=0 THEN GOTO 4020
4010 I%=I%+1
4011 IF I%<KN% THEN GOTO 4007
4012 CR%=PR% : CX%=RX% : CY%=RY%
4013 RETURN
4020 REM ---- ROTATION ACCEPTED WITH KICK I% ----
4021 IF KY%(I%)<0 THEN UP%=UP%-KY%(I%)
4022 IF AC%=1 THEN GOTO 4030
4023 REM SETTLE DOWN ONLY THE ARTIFICIAL LIFT OF EARLIER KICKS
4024 IF UP%<=0 THEN GOTO 4030
4025 CY%=CY%+1
4026 GOSUB 3600
4027 IF Q%=1 THEN GOTO 4029
4028 UP%=UP%-1 : GOTO 4024
4029 CY%=CY%-1
4030 GOSUB 5100
4031 GOSUB 3800
4032 RETURN
5000 REM ---- SNAPSHOT CURRENT PIECE INTO THE OLD CELL SET ----
5001 PT%=CT% : PR%=CR% : PX%=CX% : PY%=CY%
5002 SI%=(PT%-1)*4+PR%
5003 FOR I%=0 TO 3
5004 AX%(I%)=PX%+SX%(SI%,I%) : AY%(I%)=PY%+SY%(SI%,I%)
5005 NEXT I%
5006 RETURN
5100 REM ---- DIFFERENTIAL RENDER: OLD SET AX/AY -> CURRENT PIECE ----
5101 REM BOTH SETS ARE IN BOARD COORDINATES, SO A ONE CELL MOVE
5102 REM TOUCHES ONLY THE CELLS THAT REALLY APPEARED OR DISAPPEARED.
5103 SI%=(CT%-1)*4+CR%
5104 FOR I%=0 TO 3
5105 NX%(I%)=CX%+SX%(SI%,I%) : NY%(I%)=CY%+SY%(SI%,I%)
5106 NEXT I%
5107 FOR I%=0 TO 3
5108 Z%=0
5109 FOR J%=0 TO 3
5110 IF AX%(I%)<>NX%(J%) THEN GOTO 5112
5111 IF AY%(I%)=NY%(J%) THEN Z%=1
5112 NEXT J%
5113 IF Z%=1 THEN GOTO 5115
5114 GX%=AX%(I%) : GY%=AY%(I%) : GOSUB 8100
5115 NEXT I%
5116 FOR I%=0 TO 3
5117 Z%=0
5118 FOR J%=0 TO 3
5119 IF NX%(I%)<>AX%(J%) THEN GOTO 5121
5120 IF NY%(I%)=AY%(J%) THEN Z%=1
5121 NEXT J%
5122 IF Z%=1 THEN GOTO 5124
5123 GX%=NX%(I%) : GY%=NY%(I%) : V%=CT% : GOSUB 8000
5124 NEXT I%
5125 RETURN
6000 REM ---- LOCK THE PIECE INTO THE BOARD ----
6001 SI%=(CT%-1)*4+CR%
6002 FOR I%=0 TO 3
6003 X%=CX%+SX%(SI%,I%) : Y%=CY%+SY%(SI%,I%)
6004 IF Y%>=0 THEN BD%(X%,Y%)=CT%
6005 NEXT I%
6006 GOSUB 6200
6007 GOSUB 2000
6008 RETURN
6200 REM ---- COUNT AND REMOVE FULL ROWS ----
6201 NC%=0
6202 FOR Y%=0 TO BH%-1
6203 Z%=1
6204 FOR X%=0 TO BW%-1
6205 IF BD%(X%,Y%)=0 THEN Z%=0
6206 NEXT X%
6207 IF Z%=1 THEN NC%=NC%+1
6208 NEXT Y%
6209 IF NC%=0 THEN RETURN
6210 GOSUB 6400
6211 GOSUB 6500
6212 RETURN
6400 REM ---- COMPACT THE BOARD, REDRAW ONLY CELLS THAT CHANGED ----
6401 W%=BH%-1
6402 FOR Y%=BH%-1 TO 0 STEP -1
6403 Z%=1
6404 FOR X%=0 TO BW%-1
6405 IF BD%(X%,Y%)=0 THEN Z%=0
6406 NEXT X%
6407 IF Z%=1 THEN GOTO 6410
6408 GOSUB 6600
6409 W%=W%-1
6410 NEXT Y%
6411 IF W%<0 THEN RETURN
6412 FOR Y%=W% TO 0 STEP -1
6413 GOSUB 6700
6414 NEXT Y%
6415 RETURN
6600 REM ---- COPY ROW Y% ONTO ROW W% ----
6601 IF Y%=W% THEN RETURN
6602 FOR X%=0 TO BW%-1
6603 IF BD%(X%,W%)=BD%(X%,Y%) THEN GOTO 6608
6604 BD%(X%,W%)=BD%(X%,Y%)
6605 GX%=X% : GY%=W% : V%=BD%(X%,W%)
6606 IF V%=0 THEN GOSUB 8100
6607 IF V%>0 THEN GOSUB 8000
6608 NEXT X%
6609 RETURN
6700 REM ---- BLANK ROW Y% ----
6701 FOR X%=0 TO BW%-1
6702 IF BD%(X%,Y%)=0 THEN GOTO 6705
6703 BD%(X%,Y%)=0
6704 GX%=X% : GY%=Y% : GOSUB 8100
6705 NEXT X%
6706 RETURN
6500 REM ---- SCORE AND LEVEL FOR NC% CLEARED ROWS ----
6501 IF NC%=1 THEN SC=SC+100*(LV%+1)
6502 IF NC%=2 THEN SC=SC+300*(LV%+1)
6503 IF NC%=3 THEN SC=SC+600*(LV%+1)
6504 IF NC%=4 THEN SC=SC+1000*(LV%+1)
6505 LN%=LN%+NC%
6506 Z%=INT(LN%/10)
6507 IF Z%>LX% THEN Z%=LX%
6508 IF Z%>LV% THEN LV%=Z%
6509 GOSUB 7100
6510 GOSUB 7200
6511 RETURN
7000 REM ---- STATIC UI: CLEAR, FRAME, LABELS ----
7001 COLOR TC%,0
7002 CLS
7003 FC%=TC%
7004 PA%=BX%-3 : PB%=BY%-3 : PC%=BX%-3 : PD%=BY%+BH%*CS%+2 : GOSUB 8650
7005 PA%=BX%+BW%*CS%+2 : PC%=PA% : GOSUB 8650
7006 PA%=BX%-3 : PB%=BY%-3 : PC%=BX%+BW%*CS%+2 : PD%=BY%-3 : GOSUB 8650
7007 PB%=BY%+BH%*CS%+2 : PD%=PB% : GOSUB 8650
7008 TX%=QX% : TY%=8 : LI%=4 : GOSUB 7600
7009 TX%=QX% : TY%=90 : LI%=1 : GOSUB 7600
7010 TX%=QX% : TY%=130 : LI%=2 : GOSUB 7600
7011 TX%=QX% : TY%=170 : LI%=3 : GOSUB 7600
7012 RETURN
7100 REM ---- REDRAW SCORE ----
7101 NU=SC : ND%=6 : TX%=QX% : TY%=108
7102 GOSUB 7500
7103 RETURN
7200 REM ---- REDRAW LEVEL AND LINES ----
7201 NU=LV% : ND%=2 : TX%=QX% : TY%=148
7202 GOSUB 7500
7203 NU=LN% : ND%=3 : TX%=QX% : TY%=188
7204 GOSUB 7500
7205 RETURN
7300 REM ---- REDRAW THE NEXT PREVIEW ----
7301 PA%=QX% : PB%=QY% : PC%=QX%+4*CS%-1 : PD%=QY%+4*CS%-1
7302 GOSUB 8620
7303 SI%=(NT%-1)*4
7304 FC%=CC%(NT%)
7305 FOR I%=0 TO 3
7306 PA%=QX%+SX%(SI%,I%)*CS% : PB%=QY%+SY%(SI%,I%)*CS%
7307 PC%=PA%+CS%-CG%-1 : PD%=PB%+CS%-CG%-1
7308 GOSUB 8600
7309 NEXT I%
7310 FC%=TC%
7311 RETURN
7500 REM ---- DRAW NUMBER NU AT TX%,TY% IN ND% DIGITS ----
7501 GOSUB 7700
7502 NW=NU
7503 FOR I%=ND%-1 TO 0 STEP -1
7504 J%=INT(NW/10) : GI%=NW-J%*10 : NW=J%
7505 GA%=TX%+I%*4*GS% : GB%=TY%
7506 GOSUB 8300
7507 NEXT I%
7508 RETURN
7600 REM ---- DRAW LABEL LI% AT TX%,TY% ----
7601 FOR I%=0 TO LL%(LI%)-1
7602 GI%=LB%(LI%,I%)
7603 GA%=TX%+I%*4*GS% : GB%=TY%
7604 GOSUB 8300
7605 NEXT I%
7606 RETURN
7700 REM ---- CLEAR ND% CHARACTER CELLS AT TX%,TY% ----
7701 PA%=TX% : PB%=TY%
7702 PC%=TX%+ND%*4*GS%-1 : PD%=TY%+5*GS%-1
7703 GOSUB 8620
7704 RETURN
8000 REM ---- DRAW BOARD CELL GX%,GY% OF PIECE TYPE V% ----
8001 IF GY%<0 THEN RETURN
8002 FC%=CC%(V%)
8003 PA%=BX%+GX%*CS% : PB%=BY%+GY%*CS%
8004 PC%=PA%+CS%-CG%-1 : PD%=PB%+CS%-CG%-1
8005 GOSUB 8600
8006 DC%=DC%+1
8007 FC%=TC%
8008 RETURN
8100 REM ---- ERASE BOARD CELL GX%,GY% ----
8101 IF GY%<0 THEN RETURN
8102 PA%=BX%+GX%*CS% : PB%=BY%+GY%*CS%
8103 PC%=PA%+CS%-CG%-1 : PD%=PB%+CS%-CG%-1
8104 GOSUB 8620
8105 EC%=EC%+1
8106 RETURN
8300 REM ---- DRAW GLYPH GI% AT GA%,GB%, PIXEL SIZE GS% ----
8301 FOR H%=0 TO 4
8302 W%=FT%(GI%,H%)
8303 FOR GZ%=0 TO 2
8304 GE%=INT(W%/100)
8305 W%=(W%-GE%*100)*10
8306 IF GE%=0 THEN GOTO 8310
8307 PA%=GA%+GZ%*GS% : PB%=GB%+H%*GS%
8308 PC%=PA%+GS%-1 : PD%=PB%+GS%-1
8309 GOSUB 8600
8310 NEXT GZ%
8311 NEXT H%
8312 RETURN
8600 REM ---- GRAPHICS ADAPTER: FILL PA%,PB%-PC%,PD% IN COLOR FC% ----
8601 REM IF THIS BASIC REJECTS THE @ FORM, DROP BOTH @ SIGNS HERE AND
8602 REM IN 8621 AND 8651. IF IT REJECTS THE COLOR ARGUMENT, USE
8603 REM COLOR FC% : LINE @(PA%,PB%)-@(PC%,PD%),,BF
8604 LINE @(PA%,PB%)-@(PC%,PD%),FC%,BF
8605 RETURN
8620 REM ---- FILL PA%,PB%-PC%,PD% WITH THE BACKGROUND COLOR ----
8621 LINE @(PA%,PB%)-@(PC%,PD%),0,BF
8622 RETURN
8650 REM ---- LINE PA%,PB%-PC%,PD% IN COLOR FC% ----
8651 LINE @(PA%,PB%)-@(PC%,PD%),FC%
8652 RETURN
9000 REM ---- RESET DEBUG COUNTERS ----
9001 DC%=0 : EC%=0
9002 RETURN
9010 REM ---- SHOW DRAW/ERASE COUNTERS ----
9011 NU=DC% : ND%=3 : TX%=400 : TY%=248 : GOSUB 7500
9012 NU=EC% : ND%=3 : TX%=452 : TY%=248 : GOSUB 7500
9013 RETURN
10000 REM ================= SHAPE TABLES =================
10001 REM PER TYPE: ROTATIONS, SPAWN X, COLOR, THEN FOUR X,Y PAIRS PER
10002 REM ROTATION. Y GROWS DOWNWARDS. ALL OFFSETS FIT A 4X4 BOX, SO NO
10003 REM HIDDEN ROWS ABOVE THE WELL ARE NEEDED.
10004 REM T, J AND L ROTATE AROUND THE CELL (1,1); I, S AND Z HAVE TWO
10005 REM ORIENTATIONS AND O HAS ONE. THE CENTRE IS CHOSEN SO THAT A
10006 REM QUARTER TURN KEEPS AS MANY CELLS AS POSSIBLE: T KEEPS THREE.
10010 REM I
10011 DATA 2,3,1
10012 DATA 0,1, 1,1, 2,1, 3,1
10013 DATA 1,0, 1,1, 1,2, 1,3
10020 REM O
10021 DATA 1,4,2
10022 DATA 0,0, 1,0, 0,1, 1,1
10030 REM T
10031 DATA 4,3,3
10032 DATA 0,1, 1,1, 2,1, 1,2
10033 DATA 1,0, 0,1, 1,1, 1,2
10034 DATA 1,0, 0,1, 1,1, 2,1
10035 DATA 1,0, 1,1, 2,1, 1,2
10040 REM S
10041 DATA 2,3,4
10042 DATA 1,1, 2,1, 0,2, 1,2
10043 DATA 0,0, 0,1, 1,1, 1,2
10050 REM Z
10051 DATA 2,3,5
10052 DATA 0,1, 1,1, 1,2, 2,2
10053 DATA 1,0, 0,1, 1,1, 0,2
10060 REM J
10061 DATA 4,3,6
10062 DATA 0,0, 0,1, 1,1, 2,1
10063 DATA 1,0, 2,0, 1,1, 1,2
10064 DATA 0,1, 1,1, 2,1, 2,2
10065 DATA 1,0, 1,1, 0,2, 1,2
10070 REM L
10071 DATA 4,3,7
10072 DATA 2,0, 0,1, 1,1, 2,1
10073 DATA 1,0, 1,1, 1,2, 2,2
10074 DATA 0,1, 1,1, 2,1, 0,2
10075 DATA 0,0, 1,0, 1,1, 1,2
10100 REM ================= KICK OFFSETS =================
10101 REM COUNT, THEN X,Y PAIRS TRIED IN THIS ORDER. SIDEWAYS FIRST SO
10102 REM THAT A PIECE NEXT TO A WALL IS NOT LIFTED FOR NOTHING; THE
